       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_5">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;否在训练前对特征进行缩放（如标准化）。布尔值（&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;False&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;），通常作为独立的预处理步骤。对于极端随机树这类基于树结构的模型，​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;通常不需要&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;进行特征缩放。因为树模型基于特征值的大小关系进行分裂，缩放不会改变数据的内部排序，因此对模型结果没有影响。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
